Program: err-t.py, ver. 2024-12-16
Author:  V.Zerkin, v.zerkin@gmail.com, Vienna, 2024
Purpose: execute SQL command on SQLite
         to find EXFOR datasets with ERR-T<=0

Running: 2026-08-25 23:14:50

___getConnSQLite: file:../../x4sqlite1.db?mode=ro
SQL:

SELECT distinct substr(DatasetID,1,5) as Entry
,DatasetID,idat
,json_extract(x4.xdat,'$.ERR-T') as `ERR-T`
,xdat
FROM x4pro_x4data as x4
where json_extract(x4.xdat,'$.ERR-T') is not null
and json_extract(x4.xdat,'$.ERR-T') <=0


